couchlink incorporates methodologies from:

- Rohomieo (https://github.com/jrb00013/rohomieo) — WebRTC signaling session flow,
  PIN lockout, motion-idle FPS, WireGuard-first posture.
- dualsensekit (https://github.com/jrb00013/dualsensekit) — DualSense HID report IDs,
  enumeration preferences, and RPCS3 pad-binding practices.

